---
// Self-auditing: replay the same immutable log on a parallel pipeline and compare with the live view.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 366" role="img" aria-label="The immutable event log feeds a live pipeline that updates the view users read, and an audit pipeline that rebuilds a view from scratch. A comparison step checks sums and checksums, and a mismatch raises an alert.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Recompute from the log and compare</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tính lại từ log rồi so sánh</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="130" width="180" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="log" x={45} y={162} size={26} />
      <text x="134" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Immutable log</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Log bất biến</tspan></text>
      <text x="134" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>all the inputs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>toàn bộ đầu vào</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="50" width="210" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={265} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="369" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Live pipeline</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pipeline chạy thật</tspan></text>
      <text x="369" y="93" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>updates the view</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cập nhật khung nhìn</tspan></text>
      <rect x="490" y="50" width="190" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={515} y={80} size={26} />
      <text x="609" y="76" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Live view</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khung nhìn thật</tspan></text>
      <text x="609" y="93" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>users read this</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>người dùng đọc</tspan></text>
      <rect x="240" y="214" width="210" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box is-dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="worker" x={265} y={244} size={26} />
      <text x="369" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Audit pipeline</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Pipeline kiểm toán</tspan></text>
      <text x="369" y="257" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>replays the same log</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy lại cùng log</tspan></text>
      <rect x="490" y="214" width="190" height="60" rx="4" class="unb-box is-dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="db" x={515} y={244} size={26} />
      <text x="609" y="240" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Rebuilt view</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>View dựng lại</tspan></text>
      <text x="609" y="257" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>recomputed</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tính lại</tspan></text>
      <rect x="710" y="130" width="170" height="64" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={735} y={162} size={26} />
      <text x="819" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Compare</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>So sánh</tspan></text>
      <text x="819" y="175" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>sums, checksums</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tổng, checksum</tspan></text>
      <path d="M200,150 L220,150 L220,80 L233,80" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="232,75.5 232,84.5 240,80" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M200,174 L220,174 L220,244 L233,244" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="232,239.5 232,248.5 240,244" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M450,80 L483,80" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="482,75.5 482,84.5 490,80" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M450,244 L483,244" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="482,239.5 482,248.5 490,244" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M680,80 L795,80 L795,123" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="790.5,122 799.5,122 795,130" class="unb-head" />
      <path d="M680,244 L795,244 L795,201" class="unb-solid" /><polygon points="790.5,202 799.5,202 795,194" class="unb-head" />
      <text x="20" y="308" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-good"><tspan data-lang-en>Match: nothing to do.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khớp: không cần làm gì.</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="330" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>Mismatch: raise an alert, then replay the log to see what changed.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lệch: báo động, rồi chạy lại log để xem điều gì đã đổi.</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="352" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Storage follows the same habit: read files back, compare replica checksums, restore backups.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu trữ cũng theo thói quen này: đọc lại file, so checksum giữa các bản sao, thử khôi phục backup.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Because inputs are immutable and the functions are deterministic, a second pipeline can rebuild the answer and check the first one.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì đầu vào bất biến và các hàm xác định, một pipeline thứ hai có thể dựng lại kết quả để kiểm tra pipeline đầu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
